the same performance on ImageNet classification has been decreasing by a factor of 2 every 16 months. Compared to 2012, it now takes 44 times less compute to train a neural network to the level of AlexNet (by contrast, Moore’s Law would yield an 11x cost improvement over this period). Our results suggest that for AI tasks with high levels of recent investment, algorithmic progress has yielded more gains than classical hardware efficiency.","date":"2020-05-05T07:00:00+00:00","topics":["tech","umwelt"],"cat":"en-ai","boost":0,"cluster":null,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"6580616f2b6a","source":"EU-Rechnungshof","title":"Das EU-Kernstraßennetz: kürzere Fahrzeiten, aber das Netz ist noch nicht uneingeschränkt funktionsfähig","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxObjNBbmkxTWdzUXMzODN3MlB6SVhxYWJWb21RanlmdlhUUkM0VDdLc1ZlS3ZSSVdwdmdMV2tjblJ6cXEzMEk5V0V4eHp1VF9VTGlpal8ycm9aUTk3WTR2UmhPOE5SOFN4R29Icko2cmdhenVicXlNbTlXSFkxNzJkTw?oc=5","desc":"Das EU-Kernstraßennetz: kürzere Fahrzeiten, aber das Netz ist noch nicht uneingeschränkt funktionsfähig European Court of Auditors","date":"2020-05-05T07:00:00+00:00","topics":[],"cat":"eca","boost":0,"cluster":1,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"132c152ffd06","source":"Landtag Bremen","title":"Ausschusssitzung LIVE - bremische-buergerschaft.de","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE9lcGFzOUpyeC0zVWlRVXl6dHZTR2Vvb21tZVFEUUUyd1N4WGFobnRfQW5GemVDSmNyOHJZeG9fbTFLcmdYaFdLc2NqcU9YcXFGcFFvWklxS0V1dWV2d3R3OTQ4QjRHZ1lKbkItQTNqS0phZnFU?oc=5","desc":"Ausschusssitzung LIVE bremische-buergerschaft.de","date":"2020-05-02T16:22:15+00:00","topics":[],"cat":"hb","boost":0,"cluster":1,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"2b2b7981e35a","source":"ZDF","title":"Startseite – ZDF goes Schule - ZDF Schule","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiOkFVX3lxTE14X3p6SWlZak1mUkd4NW1qQzZBN3QtTkdYS0dfZ0pzTkl2SndxaWZoM3VFUFdoU0lvR1E?oc=5","desc":"Startseite – ZDF goes Schule ZDF Schule","date":"2020-05-